Z||000000||Formula88||09-25-2001||09:15 AM||||I've noticed a lot of people put the flag at half staff in their sig files.  This is a very nice tribute, but I wanted to remind everyone who hasn't changed it yet that President Bush ordered the flag raised to full staff on last Sunday.  It is now inappropriate to display the flag at half-staff.  <P>I know a sig file isn't a real flag, but I thought the people who took the time and effort to add it to their sig file would want to know it's time to raise Old Glory back to full height.||||reg||3
